# Offline First

This app is **Offline First**.

- **Local storage (Room, DataStore) is the source of truth.** UI reads from local DB/cache.
- **Network is for sync.** Sync in the background (WorkManager); update local DB; UI observes local data.
- **Design for no connectivity.** Features work without internet; show cached content; retry sync when back online.
